    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious five-bedroom detached family home situated in the established and popular Treacy Meadows, Newbridge.\n\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation extending over two floors and provides excellent flexibility for modern family living. On entering, the welcoming  entrance hallway leads to a generously sized living/dining room, kitchen, utility room and guest WC. A particularly appealing feature is the large downstairs bedroom, complete with its own ensuite, making it ideal for a family member, guest accommodation or those seeking convenient ground-floor living. Upstairs, there are four further well-proportioned bedrooms. The main bedroom benefits from its own ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are served by a family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property provides ample off-street parking to the front, while to the rear is a private garden with patio area, offering excellent potential for outdoor dining, entertaining and family use.\n\nWhile the property would benefit from some modernization and updating throughout, it presents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to put their own stamp on a substantial detached home and create a modern family residence to their own requirements.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Carpet flooring, alarm point\n\nKitchen: Tiled flooring, light fitting, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, double oven, hob, extractor fan\n\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring, worktop, back door leading to rear garden area\n\nLiving/Dining Room: Carpet flooring, feature fireplace, sliding patio doors leading to rear garden\n\nBedroom 1: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nEnsuite: Tiled floor to ceiling, shower unit, WHB, WC\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 4: Carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 5 (Downstairs): Carpet flooring\n\nEnsuite: Lino flooring, tiled surround, shower unit, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket\n\nFamily Bathroom: Lino flooring, tiled surround, bath with shower, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket\n\nFeatures:\n\nFully alarmed\nHardwood front door\nPVC double glazed windows\nSelected carpets, curtains, blinds and light fittings included\nAttic access\nOutside tap\nOutside light\nPatio area to rear\nSide gates\nNot overlooked\nOil fired central heating\nMains water\nMains sewage\nBuilt in 1990\nc.150.74sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
      },
